{"page":328,"verses":[{"verse_key":"21:73","surah":21,"ayah":73,"ar_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ أَئِمَّةً يَهْدُونَ بِأَمْرِنَا وَأَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْهِمْ فِعْلَ ٱلْخَيْرَٰتِ وَإِقَامَ ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ وَإِيتَآءَ ٱلزَّكَوٰةِ ۖ وَكَانُوا۟ لَنَا عَـٰبِدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We made all of them leaders, guiding others by Our command, and We inspired them to do good works, to keep up the prayer, and to give alms: they were Our true worshippers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"And We made them","transliteration":"wajaʿalnāhum","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَئِمَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"leaders","transliteration":"a-immatan","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَهْدُونَ","en_gloss":"they guide","transliteration":"yahdūna","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِأَمْرِنَا","en_gloss":"by Our Command","transliteration":"bi-amrinā","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"And We inspired","transliteration":"wa-awḥaynā","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ilayhim","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِعْلَ","en_gloss":"(the) doing","transliteration":"fiʿ'la","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْخَيْرَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) good deeds","transliteration":"l-khayrāti","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَإِقَامَ","en_gloss":"and establishment","transliteration":"wa-iqāma","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalati","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَإِيتَآءَ","en_gloss":"and giving","transliteration":"waītāa","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلزَّكَوٰةِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) zakah","transliteration":"l-zakati","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَكَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"and they were","transliteration":"wakānū","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَنَا","en_gloss":"of Us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عَـٰبِدِينَ","en_gloss":"worshippers","transliteration":"ʿābidīna","verse_key":"21:73"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٧٣","en_gloss":"(73)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:73"}]},{"verse_key":"21:74","surah":21,"ayah":74,"ar_uthmani":"وَلُوطًا ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ حُكْمًا وَعِلْمًا وَنَجَّيْنَـٰهُ مِنَ ٱلْقَرْيَةِ ٱلَّتِى كَانَت تَّعْمَلُ ٱلْخَبَـٰٓئِثَ ۗ إِنَّهُمْ كَانُوا۟ قَوْمَ سَوْءٍ فَـٰسِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We gave Lot sound judgement and knowledge and saved him from the community who practised obscenities- they were shameless people who broke God’s law!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلُوطًا","en_gloss":"And (to) Lut","transliteration":"walūṭan","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We gave him","transliteration":"ātaynāhu","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":3,"ar":"حُكْمًۭا","en_gloss":"judgment","transliteration":"ḥuk'man","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَعِلْمًۭا","en_gloss":"and knowledge","transliteration":"waʿil'man","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَنَجَّيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"and We saved him","transliteration":"wanajjaynāhu","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْقَرْيَةِ","en_gloss":"the town","transliteration":"l-qaryati","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَانَت","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kānat","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَّعْمَلُ","en_gloss":"doing","transliteration":"taʿmalu","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْخَبَـٰٓئِثَ ۗ","en_gloss":"wicked deeds","transliteration":"l-khabāitha","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"Indeed, they","transliteration":"innahum","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قَوْمَ","en_gloss":"a people","transliteration":"qawma","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":15,"ar":"سَوْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"evil","transliteration":"sawin","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَـٰسِقِينَ","en_gloss":"defiantly disobedient","transliteration":"fāsiqīna","verse_key":"21:74"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٧٤","en_gloss":"(74)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:74"}]},{"verse_key":"21:75","surah":21,"ayah":75,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَدْخَلْنَـٰهُ فِى رَحْمَتِنَآ ۖ إِنَّهُۥ مِنَ ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We admitted him to Our mercy; he was a righteous man.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَدْخَلْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"And We admitted him","transliteration":"wa-adkhalnāhu","verse_key":"21:75"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"into","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"21:75"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَحْمَتِنَآ ۖ","en_gloss":"Our Mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatinā","verse_key":"21:75"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, he","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"21:75"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"(was) of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"21:75"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","en_gloss":"the righteous","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥīna","verse_key":"21:75"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٧٥","en_gloss":"(75)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:75"}]},{"verse_key":"21:76","surah":21,"ayah":76,"ar_uthmani":"وَنُوحًا إِذْ نَادَىٰ مِن قَبْلُ فَٱسْتَجَبْنَا لَهُۥ فَنَجَّيْنَـٰهُ وَأَهْلَهُۥ مِنَ ٱلْكَرْبِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Long before that, We answered Noah when he cried out to Us: We saved him and his family from the great calamity","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَنُوحًا","en_gloss":"And Nuh","transliteration":"wanūḥan","verse_key":"21:76"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"21:76"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَادَىٰ","en_gloss":"he called","transliteration":"nādā","verse_key":"21:76"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:76"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَبْلُ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"21:76"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَٱسْتَجَبْنَا","en_gloss":"so We responded","transliteration":"fa-is'tajabnā","verse_key":"21:76"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"to him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"21:76"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَنَجَّيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"and We saved him","transliteration":"fanajjaynāhu","verse_key":"21:76"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأَهْلَهُۥ","en_gloss":"and his family","transliteration":"wa-ahlahu","verse_key":"21:76"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"21:76"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْكَرْبِ","en_gloss":"the affliction","transliteration":"l-karbi","verse_key":"21:76"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْعَظِيمِ","en_gloss":"[the] great","transliteration":"l-ʿaẓīmi","verse_key":"21:76"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٧٦","en_gloss":"(76)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:76"}]},{"verse_key":"21:77","surah":21,"ayah":77,"ar_uthmani":"وَنَصَرْنَـٰهُ مِنَ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ ۚ إِنَّهُمْ كَانُوا۟ قَوْمَ سَوْءٍ فَأَغْرَقْنَـٰهُمْ أَجْمَعِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and We helped him against the people who rejected Our signs- they were evil people, so We drowned them all.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَنَصَرْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"And We helped him","transliteration":"wanaṣarnāhu","verse_key":"21:77"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"21:77"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-qawmi","verse_key":"21:77"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"21:77"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَذَّبُوا۟","en_gloss":"denied","transliteration":"kadhabū","verse_key":"21:77"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ ۚ","en_gloss":"Our Signs","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"21:77"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"Indeed, they","transliteration":"innahum","verse_key":"21:77"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"21:77"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قَوْمَ","en_gloss":"a people","transliteration":"qawma","verse_key":"21:77"},{"pos":10,"ar":"سَوْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"evil","transliteration":"sawin","verse_key":"21:77"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَأَغْرَقْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"so We drowned them","transliteration":"fa-aghraqnāhum","verse_key":"21:77"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَجْمَعِينَ","en_gloss":"all","transliteration":"ajmaʿīna","verse_key":"21:77"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٧٧","en_gloss":"(77)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:77"}]},{"verse_key":"21:78","surah":21,"ayah":78,"ar_uthmani":"وَدَاوُۥدَ وَسُلَيْمَـٰنَ إِذْ يَحْكُمَانِ فِى ٱلْحَرْثِ إِذْ نَفَشَتْ فِيهِ غَنَمُ ٱلْقَوْمِ وَكُنَّا لِحُكْمِهِمْ شَـٰهِدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"And remember David and Solomon, when they gave judgement regarding the field into which sheep strayed by night and grazed. We witnessed their judgement","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَدَاوُۥدَ","en_gloss":"And Dawud","transliteration":"wadāwūda","verse_key":"21:78"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَسُلَيْمَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"and Sulaiman","transliteration":"wasulaymāna","verse_key":"21:78"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"21:78"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَحْكُمَانِ","en_gloss":"they judged","transliteration":"yaḥkumāni","verse_key":"21:78"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"concerning","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"21:78"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْحَرْثِ","en_gloss":"the field","transliteration":"l-ḥarthi","verse_key":"21:78"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"21:78"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نَفَشَتْ","en_gloss":"pastured","transliteration":"nafashat","verse_key":"21:78"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"21:78"},{"pos":10,"ar":"غَنَمُ","en_gloss":"sheep","transliteration":"ghanamu","verse_key":"21:78"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"(of) a people","transliteration":"l-qawmi","verse_key":"21:78"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَكُنَّا","en_gloss":"and We were","transliteration":"wakunnā","verse_key":"21:78"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِحُكْمِهِمْ","en_gloss":"to their judgment","transliteration":"liḥuk'mihim","verse_key":"21:78"},{"pos":14,"ar":"شَـٰهِدِينَ","en_gloss":"witness","transliteration":"shāhidīna","verse_key":"21:78"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٧٨