":"٧٩","en_gloss":"(79)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:79"}]},{"verse_key":"21:80","surah":21,"ayah":80,"ar_uthmani":"وَعَلَّمْنَـٰهُ صَنْعَةَ لَبُوسٍ لَّكُمْ لِتُحْصِنَكُم مِّنۢ بَأْسِكُمْ ۖ فَهَلْ أَنتُمْ شَـٰكِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We taught him how to make coats of mail for the benefit of you [people], to protect you in your wars, but are you grateful for this?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَعَلَّمْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"And We taught him","transliteration":"waʿallamnāhu","verse_key":"21:80"},{"pos":2,"ar":"صَنْعَةَ","en_gloss":"(the) making","transliteration":"ṣanʿata","verse_key":"21:80"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَبُوسٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of) coats of armor","transliteration":"labūsin","verse_key":"21:80"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"21:80"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِتُحْصِنَكُم","en_gloss":"to protect you","transliteration":"lituḥ'ṣinakum","verse_key":"21:80"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:80"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَأْسِكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"your battle","transliteration":"basikum","verse_key":"21:80"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَهَلْ","en_gloss":"Then will","transliteration":"fahal","verse_key":"21:80"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"antum","verse_key":"21:80"},{"pos":10,"ar":"شَـٰكِرُونَ","en_gloss":"(be) grateful","transliteration":"shākirūna","verse_key":"21:80"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٨٠","en_gloss":"(80)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:80"}]},{"verse_key":"21:81","surah":21,"ayah":81,"ar_uthmani":"وَلِسُلَيْمَـٰنَ ٱلرِّيحَ عَاصِفَةً تَجْرِى بِأَمْرِهِۦٓ إِلَى ٱلْأَرْضِ ٱلَّتِى بَـٰرَكْنَا فِيهَا ۚ وَكُنَّا بِكُلِّ شَىْءٍ عَـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We harnessed the stormy wind for Solomon, so that it sped by his command to the land We had blessed- We have knowledge of all things-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلِسُلَيْمَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"And to Sulaiman","transliteration":"walisulaymāna","verse_key":"21:81"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلرِّيحَ","en_